    {
      "flavor_text": "Seemingly curious about people,\nthey gather around footsteps they\nfind on snowy mountains.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/22/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "さむい　きせつは　やまの　ふもとまで\nおりてくるが　はるに　なると　ゆきが\nのこる　さんちょうに　もどっていく。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "추운 계절에는 산기슭까지\n내려오지만 봄이 되면 눈이\n남아 있는 산 정상으로 돌아간다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il s’aventure jusqu’au pied des montagnes en hiver,\nmais se réfugie sur les pics neigeux au printemps.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Im Winter steigt es bis zum Fuß der Berge herab.\nIm Frühjahr kehrt es auf den Gipfel zurück.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "En las estaciones frías baja al pie de la montaña, pero\nregresa a las cimas nevadas en primavera.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "In inverno scende a valle, ma in primavera se ne\ntorna sulle cime montuose dove c’è ancora neve.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "During cold seasons, it migrates to the mountain’s\nlower reaches. It returns to the snow-covered\nsummit in the spring.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "寒い　季節は　山の　ふもとまで\n降りてくるが　春に　なると\n雪が　残る　山頂に　戻っていく。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "En las estaciones frías baja al pie de la montaña, pero\nregresa a las cimas nevadas en primavera.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "はるになると　アイスキャンディーの\nような　しょっかんの　きのみが\nおなかの　まわりに　なる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "봄이 되면 아이스캔디와\n같은 촉감의 나무열매가\n배의 주위에 열린다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Au printemps, il fait pousser des Baies pareilles à\ndes crèmes glacées autour de son ventre.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Im Frühjahr wachsen Beeren, die wie gefrorene\nSüßigkeiten aussehen, um seinen Bauch herum.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "En primavera, le crecen bayas con apariencia de\nhelado alrededor de la panza.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "In primavera, attorno al ventre gli crescono delle\nbacche simili a dolci ghiaccioli.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "In the spring, it grows berries with the texture of\nfrozen treats around its belly.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
